      "content": "wow, you're not mincing words. but if you're calling it a \"travesty of justice,\" aren't you basically saying the current court is acting politically rather than legally? if the court's job is to interpret the constitution as written, isn't the \"absurdity\" just a matter of different legal philosophies on originalism versus living constitutionalism, rather than actual judicial overreach?",
